<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<!-- PAGE HERO -->
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero__bg"></div>
  <div class="page-hero__accent"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-hero__label">Techo Xpress / About Us</div>
    <h1 class="page-hero__title">THE <em>MUSCLE</em><br>OF TECHO.</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STORY -->
<section class="about-story">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-story__inner">

      <div class="about-story__aside">
        <div class="about-story__bg-num" aria-hidden="true">TX</div>
        <div class="mono-label">Our Story</div>
        <h2 class="section-title reveal" style="font-size:2rem; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Built to<br><em>Move.</em></h2>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:0.5rem;">
          Work With Us
          <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="reveal">Techo Xpress was born from a simple but powerful frustration: Sri Lankan businesses deserved a courier service that actually behaved like one. Not one that left customers guessing, offered no real-time updates, and treated accountability as optional.</p>

        <p class="reveal" data-d="1">As the logistics arm of the Techo Traders ecosystem, Xpress carries the same philosophy that drives the parent company — precision, integration, and a refusal to accept "good enough." We are the physical counterpart to everything Techo Labs builds digitally.</p>

        <p class="reveal" data-d="2">What makes us different isn't just speed. It's that the technology powering our operations — the tracking, the fleet management, the customer notifications — was built in-house by Techo Labs. That means when a problem needs solving, we solve it ourselves. Faster, smarter, and with full ownership.</p>

        <p class="reveal" data-d="3">We started with a handful of riders and a big promise. That promise — <em>Speed. Precision. Delivered.</em> — is still the standard we hold on every single shipment.</p>

        <blockquote class="reveal" data-d="3">
          "If Techo Labs is the brain of the operation, Techo Xpress is the muscle. We get things where they need to be."
        </blockquote>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- NUMBERS -->
<section class="numbers-band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="numbers-grid">
      <div class="number-item">
        <div class="number-item__val"><span data-count="98" data-suffix="%">0%</span></div>
        <div class="number-item__lbl">On-Time Delivery Rate</div>
      </div>
      <div class="number-item">
        <div class="number-item__val"><span data-count="25" data-suffix="">0</span></div>
        <div class="number-item__lbl">Districts Covered</div>
      </div>
      <div class="number-item">
        <div class="number-item__val"><span data-count="500" data-suffix="+">0+</span></div>
        <div class="number-item__lbl">Monthly Deliveries</div>
      </div>
      <div class="number-item">
        <div class="number-item__val"><span data-count="4" data-suffix="hr">0hr</span></div>
        <div class="number-item__lbl">Express Turnaround</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- VALUES -->
<section class="values-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
      <div class="mono-label" style="justify-content:center;">How We Operate</div>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">Our <em>Principles</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-block reveal">
        <div class="value-block__num">01</div>
        <div class="value-block__title">Speed is Non-Negotiable</div>
        <div class="value-block__desc">We don't treat urgency as an upsell — it's a baseline. Every shipment is handled with the same urgency we'd want for our own package.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="value-block reveal" data-d="1">
        <div class="value-block__num">02</div>
        <div class="value-block__title">Radical Transparency</div>
        <div class="value-block__desc">Senders and recipients know exactly where their package is at every step. No black holes. No guessing. Real updates, real time.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="value-block reveal" data-d="2">
        <div class="value-block__num">03</div>
        <div class="value-block__title">Accountability Built In</div>
        <div class="value-block__desc">Every delivery is confirmed with digital proof. We track our own on-time rate monthly and stand behind the numbers.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="value-block reveal" data-d="3">
        <div class="value-block__num">04</div>
        <div class="value-block__title">People, Not Ticket Numbers</div>
        <div class="value-block__desc">When something goes wrong, a real person picks up. Corporate clients get a named contact. Every sender gets a direct line.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ECOSYSTEM -->
<section class="eco-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eco-section__inner">
      <div>
        <div class="mono-label">Part of Something Bigger</div>
        <h2 class="section-title reveal" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The Techo<br><em>Ecosystem</em></h2>
        <p class="reveal">Techo Xpress is one of three companies under <a href="#" style="color:var(--orange);">Techo Traders</a>. That means we don't just have a logistics team — we have a full digital development arm (Techo Labs) and a hardware & infrastructure division (Techo Connect) working alongside us.</p>
        <p class="reveal" data-d="1">Our proprietary tracking software? Built by Techo Labs. Connectivity in remote coverage zones? Supported by Techo Connect infrastructure. This is what integrated technology looks like in practice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="eco-cards reveal" data-d="2">
        <div class="eco-card eco-card--labs">
          <div class="eco-card__emoji">🧠</div>
          <div>
            <div class="eco-card__name">Techo Labs</div>
            <div class="eco-card__desc">Builds the tracking and fleet management software that powers every Xpress shipment in real time.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="eco-card eco-card--xpress">
          <div class="eco-card__emoji">💪</div>
          <div>
            <div class="eco-card__name">Techo Xpress <span style="color:var(--orange); font-size:0.75rem;">(You're Here)</span></div>
            <div class="eco-card__desc">The logistics muscle — getting packages where they need to be, on time, every time.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="eco-card eco-card--connect">
          <div class="eco-card__emoji">📡</div>
          <div>
            <div class="eco-card__name">Techo Connect</div>
            <div class="eco-card__desc">Antenna & hardware manufacturing keeping the Xpress network connected across all 25 districts.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band__inner">
      <div>
        <div class="cta-band__title">Ready to Ship Smarter?</div>
        <div class="cta-band__sub">Get in touch and we'll find the right solution for your business.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-band__actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-white">
          Get a Quote
          <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="/services" class="btn" style="background:rgba(0,0,0,0.2); color:#fff; border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);">
          Our Services
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
